FORM 10 [See rule 19(1)] MANIFEST FOR HAZARDOUS AND OTHER WASTE — 7-copy colour-coded system:
Copy 1 (White) — Sender forwards to SPCB;
Copy 2 (Yellow) — Retained by sender (transporter signs);
Copy 3 (Pink) — Retained by receiver;
Copy 4 (Orange) — Given to transporter by receiver;
Copy 5 (Green) — Sent by receiver to receiver's SPCB;
Copy 6 (Blue) — Sent by receiver to sender;
Copy 7 (Grey) — Sent by receiver to sender's SPCB (only if sender is in another State).
The transporter shall not accept the hazardous waste without signed copies 3 to 7.
